5,1,1,talk,Misaki,,Let's start by identifying what we actually need to investigate before we can make a fair choice.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Kenji,,"I’m worried about the depot floor. Freight doesn’t pause for office projects, so we need to check how the system handles our actual yard equipment.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Toshio,,I need to see the five years of renewal invoices and the board minutes on capital and operating requests.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Yumi,,I want to understand why projects fail here. I’ll look into support ownership during last winter's outage and warehouse rule changes after new accounts.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,I’ll examine the upgrade history of the dispatch tool and the data lift in the 2018 pay move.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Misaki,,"I’ll check the administrator retirements and hiring times, plus the depot supervisors and the last rollout.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Kenji,,"I’ll look into the depot calendar and the peak-season cutover, and the yard devices and the 2021 scheduling trial.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Toshio,,I’ve already stated my choices. I’m waiting to see what the rest of you uncover before I commit further.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Yumi,,"I’m glad we’re covering the ground. I’ll stick with my two picks for now, but I’m ready to adjust if something urgent comes up.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,I’ve already committed to my two investigations. I’ll review the findings once everyone has reported back.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
